          1*       <136> ECHO                                                      OP1[  IS_CONST (268435443) '%3Cdiv+class%3D%22body_padded%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ch1%3EHelp+-+SQL+Injection%3C%2Fh1%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3Cdiv+id%3D%22code%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctable+width%3D%27100%25%27+bgcolor%3D%27white%27+style%3D%22border%3A2px+%23C0C0C0+solid%22%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctr%3E%0D%0A%09%3Ctd%3E%3Cdiv+id%3D%22code%22%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EAbout%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EA+SQL+injection+attack+consists+of+insertion+or+%22injection%22+of+a+SQL+query+via+the+input+data+from+the+client+to+the+application.%0D%0A%09%09%09A+successful+SQL+injection+exploit+can+read+sensitive+data+from+the+database%2C+modify+database+data+%28insert%2Fupdate%2Fdelete%29%2C+execute+administration+operations+on+the+database%0D%0A%09%09%09%28such+as+shutdown+the+DBMS%29%2C+recover+the+content+of+a+given+file+present+on+the+DBMS+file+system+%28load_file%29+and+in+some+cases+issue+commands+to+the+operating+system.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3ESQL+injection+attacks+are+a+type+of+injection+attack%2C+in+which+SQL+commands+are+injected+into+data-plane+input+in+order+to+effect+the+execution+of+predefined+SQL+commands.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThis+attack+may+also+be+called+%22SQLi%22.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EObjective%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThere+are+5+users+in+the+database%2C+with+id%27s+from+1+to+5.+Your+mission...+to+steal+their+passwords+via+SQLi.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%3Chr+%2F%3E%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3ELow+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+SQL+query+uses+RAW+input+that+is+directly+controlled+by+the+attacker.+All+they+need+to-do+is+escape+the+query+and+then+they+are+able%0D%0A%09%09%09to+execute+any+SQL+query+they+wish.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3E%3Fid%3Da%27+UNION+SELECT+%22text1%22%2C%22text2%22%3B--+-%26Submit%3DSubmit%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EMedium+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+medium+level+uses+a+form+of+SQL+injection+protection%2C+with+the+function+of%0D%0A%09%09%09%22' ]
