          9*       <136> ECHO                                                      OP1[  IS_CONST (268435432) '%22.%0D%0A%09%09%09However+due+to+the+SQL+query+not+having+quotes+around+the+parameter%2C+this+will+not+fully+protect+the+query+from+being+altered.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+text+box+has+been+replaced+with+a+pre-defined+dropdown+list+and+uses+POST+to+submit+the+form.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3E%3Fid%3Da+UNION+SELECT+1%2C2%3B--+-%26Submit%3DSubmit%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EHigh+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThis+is+very+similar+to+the+low+level%2C+however+this+time+the+attacker+is+inputting+the+value+in+a+different+manner.%0D%0A%09%09%09The+input+values+are+being+transferred+to+the+vulnerable+query+via+session+variables+using+another+page%2C+rather+than+a+direct+GET+request.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cpre%3ESpoiler%3A+%3Cspan+class%3D%22spoiler%22%3EID%3A+a%27+UNION+SELECT+%22text1%22%2C%22text2%22%3B--+-%26Submit%3DSubmit%3C%2Fspan%3E.%3C%2Fpre%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%09%3Ch3%3EImpossible+Level%3C%2Fh3%3E%0D%0A%09%09%3Cp%3EThe+queries+are+now+parameterized+queries+%28rather+than+being+dynamic%29.+This+means+the+query+has+been+defined+by+the+developer%2C%0D%0A%09%09%09and+has+distinguish+which+sections+are+code%2C+and+the+rest+is+data.%3C%2Fp%3E%0D%0A%09%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%0D%0A%09%3C%2Ftr%3E%0D%0A%09%3C%2Ftable%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3Cbr+%2F%3E%0D%0A%0D%0A%09%3Cp%3EReference%3A+' ]
